{"ID":"20240205153808-obybvdx","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153808-obybvdx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153808-obybvdx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113256-hkgmrw0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613123854-a44q4el\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:5500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240702104523-xz06b7y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"312芫花","type":"doc","updated":"20240826132413"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206113256-hkgmrw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113256-hkgmrw0","updated":"20240206113308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于山东、江苏、安徽等地。\n【性状】\t该品常37朵簇生于短花轴上，基部有苞片12片，多脱落为单朵。单朵呈棒槌状，多弯曲，长1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.7cm，直径约1.5mm；花被筒表面淡紫色或灰绿色，密被短柔毛，先端4裂，裂片淡紫色或黄棕色。质软。\n【性味】\t甘、苦，温，有毒。\n【功效】\t泻水逐饮，解毒杀虫。用于水肿胀满，胸腹积水，痰饮积聚，气逆喘咳，二便不利；外治疥癣秃疮，冻疮。根皮：消肿解毒，活血止痛。用于急性乳腺炎，痈疖肿毒，淋巴结结核，腹水，风湿痛，牙痛，跌打损伤。\n【炙品】\t醋芫花：取净芫花，照醋炙法炒至醋吸尽。每100kg芫花，用醋30kg。炮制后颜色加深，缓和毒性。\n【连结】\t药用植物图像数据库 中草药化学图像数据库 中药方剂图像数据库"}]},{"ID":"20240206113259-k9gmhy1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113259-k9gmhy1","updated":"20240206113259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113258-1fog4vj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160818-8r3ch47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160818-8r3ch47","updated":"20240205160818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芫花"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芫花-20240205160818-syg86pg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240702103553-phquxqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240702103553-phquxqx","updated":"20240702103614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 505px;","style":"width: 495px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芫花2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芫花2-20240702103613-ksxxccx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 495px;\" parent-style=\"width: 505px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826130206-tp51vy0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826130206-tp51vy0","updated":"20240826130238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 378px;","style":"width: 368px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芫花"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芫花-20240826130206-b6ix19i.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 368px;\" parent-style=\"width: 378px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 421px;","style":"width: 411px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芫花 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芫花 1-20240826130238-15kuvwg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 411px;\" parent-style=\"width: 421px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},